{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04138","headline":"游禁苑幸临渭亭遇雪应制 · 徐彦伯","name":"游禁苑幸临渭亭遇雪应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉律藏冰候，彤阶飞雪时。\n日寒消不尽，风定舞还迟。\n琼树留宸瞩，璇花入睿词。\n悬知穆天子，黄竹谩言诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐彦伯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04138.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04138","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}